---
---
<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[var(--border)]" id="apps">
<div class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">

<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--brand-primary)]">Mobile apps</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-3 tracking-tight">
              Shop or deliver on mobile
            </h2>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] mb-6">Find Buyer and Rider mobile app releases on GitHub. Review the release notes, available packages, and installation instructions.</p>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">

<div class="border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-4 bg-[var(--canvas)] flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
<span class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Buyer app</span>
</div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] mb-3">Shop and follow your orders on mobile.</p>
</div>
<a class="min-h-[44px] w-full px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--control-border)] hover:bg-[var(--brand-tint)] hover:border-[var(--brand-primary)] text-[var(--ink)] text-sm font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--brand-primary)] focus-visible:outline-none" href="https://github.com/ApueXI/aisley-app-customer/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                  Buyer app releases
                </a>
</div>

<div class="border border-[var(--logistics-border)] rounded-lg p-4 bg-[var(--logistics-tint)]/40 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
<span class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Rider app</span>
</div>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] mb-3">Access courier pickup and delivery workflows.</p>
</div>
<a class="min-h-[44px] w-full px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] hover:bg-[var(--logistics-tint)] text-[var(--logistics-primary)] text-sm font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--logistics-primary)] focus-visible:outline-none" href="https://github.com/ApueXI/aisley-app-rider/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                  Rider app releases
                </a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[var(--brand-tint)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
<span class="font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Courier access:</span> Couriers use the Rider mobile app and require approval from their associated Logistics organization. Sellers and Logistics teams use their dedicated web portals.
            </div>
</div>

<div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-lg p-5 space-y-4">
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--muted)]">Before you download</div>
<div class="border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-3">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Available packages</div>
<div class="font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-0.5">Check the selected release</div>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-3">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Release source</div>
<div class="font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-0.5">github.com/ApueXI/aisley-app-*</div>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-3">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Installation guidance</div>
<div class="font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-0.5">Read the release notes and instructions</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]">Device compatibility</div>
<div class="font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-0.5">Check the package requirements</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
